          "settings": {
            "title": "Cities & Towns",
            "description": "Addax electric utility vehicles combine compact design with exceptional agility, making them the ideal solution for maintaining clean and orderly cities and towns. Boasting an impressive loading capacity of up to 6 m³, these vehicles are versatile enough to handle a wide range of tasks. Whether you require an open loading platform for collecting recyclable waste or a closed platform for transporting equipment to the local sports club, there’s an electric Addax vehicle to suit your needs. Enhance the quality of life for residents with cleaner air, all at an affordable cost.",
