            "card_1_title": "City Management & Maintenance",
            "card_1_text": "Efficient waste management is essential for maintaining a healthy and thriving city. Addax all-electric utility vehicles are designed to meet your city's unique needs. Their compact size allows them to navigate areas inaccessible to traditional waste trucks, making them ideal for small cities. Retrofitted with tipping containers, they simplify waste collection, while also offering versatile solutions for maintaining roads and parks—all in an eco-friendly way.",
