            "card_1_title": "Urban Delivery Vehicles",
            "card_1_text": "With urban areas tightening restrictions on traditional vehicles, emission-free delivery solutions are more crucial than ever. Addax light utility vehicles meet these demands, offering eco-friendly efficiency without compromising capacity, helping your delivery company stay on schedule.",
            "card_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/Cost_Effective_Addax_8e120dbe-91bf-4a21-9e8f-cc51e5def217.png",
            "card_2_title": "Agile for Evolving Markets",
            "card_2_text": "Ecommerce growth poses new challenges for urban logistics. Large vehicles struggle with maneuverability, especially in areas with traffic restrictions. Addax light utility vehicles are designed to navigate narrow streets and pedestrian pathways effortlessly, making urban deliveries simpler and more efficient.",
