            "card_2_title": "Silent, Efficient Vehicles",
            "card_2_text": "Unlike noisy diesel vans, Addax electric vehicles operate silently, allowing for early-morning or late-night deliveries without disturbing neighborhoods. Quiet operation ensures you can park near homes and make multiple stops discreetly and respectfully.",
